{% extends "base.html.j2" %}
{% block title %}Ranking — Bolão das IAs · Copa 2026{% endblock %}
{% block content %}
<section class="mb-6 sm:mb-8">
  <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">Ranking geral</h1>
  <p class="text-zinc-400 text-sm mt-1">
    {% if ias %}
      {{ ias | length }} IA{{ 's' if ias | length != 1 else '' }} competindo · {{ jogos_apurados }} de {{ jogos_totais }} jogos apurados.
    {% else %}
      Nenhuma IA cadastrada ainda. Coloque palpites em <code class="bg-bg-800 px-1 rounded text-zinc-300">data/palpites_ias/&lt;slug&gt;.md</code> e rode <code class="bg-bg-800 px-1 rounded text-zinc-300">python -m bolao rodada</code>.
    {% endif %}
  </p>
</section>

{% if ias %}
<div class="overflow-x-auto -mx-4 sm:mx-0 rounded-lg ring-1 ring-bg-800">
  <table id="ranking" class="w-full text-sm">
    <thead class="bg-bg-900 text-zinc-400 uppercase text-xs tracking-wide">
      <tr>
        <th data-sort="num" class="sortable px-3 py-3 text-left">#</th>
        <th data-sort="str" class="sortable px-3 py-3 text-left">IA</th>
        <th data-sort="num" class="sortable px-3 py-3 text-right">Pontos</th>
        <th data-sort="num" class="sortable px-3 py-3 text-right hidden sm:table-cell" title="Placares exatos (10 pts cada)">P. Exatos</th>
        <th data-sort="num" class="sortable px-3 py-3 text-right hidden sm:table-cell" title="Vencedores acertados">Vencedores</th>
        <th data-sort="num" class="sortable px-3 py-3 text-right hidden md:table-cell">Palpitados</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for ia in ias %}
      <tr class="border-t border-bg-800 hover:bg-bg-900/60">
        <td class="px-3 py-3 font-mono {% if loop.index == 1 %}text-gold{% elif loop.index <= 3 %}text-accent{% else %}text-zinc-400{% endif %}">
          {{ loop.index }}{% if loop.index == 1 %} 🥇{% elif loop.index == 2 %} 🥈{% elif loop.index == 3 %} 🥉{% endif %}
        </td>
        <td class="px-3 py-3">
          <a href="ia/{{ ia.slug }}.html" class="font-medium hover:text-accent">{{ ia.nome_display }}</a>
          <div class="sm:hidden text-xs text-zinc-500 mt-1">
            {{ ia.placares_exatos }} exatos · {{ ia.vencedores_acertados }} vencedores · {{ ia.jogos_palpitados }} palpites
          </div>
        </td>
        <td class="px-3 py-3 text-right font-mono font-semibold text-lg">{{ ia.pontos }}</td>
        <td class="px-3 py-3 text-right font-mono hidden sm:table-cell">{{ ia.placares_exatos }}</td>
        <td class="px-3 py-3 text-right font-mono hidden sm:table-cell">{{ ia.vencedores_acertados }}</td>
        <td class="px-3 py-3 text-right font-mono text-zinc-400 hidden md:table-cell">{{ ia.jogos_palpitados }}</td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>

<section class="mt-6 text-xs text-zinc-500">
  <p>Desempate: pontos → placares exatos → vencedores acertados → ordem alfabética (slug). Clique no cabeçalho da coluna pra reordenar.</p>
</section>
{% else %}
<div class="rounded-lg ring-1 ring-bg-800 bg-bg-900 p-6 text-zinc-400 text-sm">
  <p class="mb-3 text-zinc-300 font-medium">Tabela vazia.</p>
  <p>Assim que o primeiro arquivo de palpites for adicionado em <code class="bg-bg-800 px-1 rounded">data/palpites_ias/</code>, a IA aparece aqui após <code class="bg-bg-800 px-1 rounded">python -m bolao rodada</code>.</p>
</div>
{% endif %}
{% endblock %}
